  "description": "Buckley Real Estate are delighted to present a brand new one bed apartment on Clanbrassil Street to the market, situated in the heart of Portobello, this one bedroom apartment enjoys a vibrant and well-connected Dublin 8 location. Portobello is a popular and established neighbourhood, known for its excellent selection of cafes, restaurants, local shops and everyday amenities.\n\nThe property is conveniently located close to Dublin city centre, providing easy access to the city’s many attractions and amenities. The surrounding area offers a mix of independent businesses, dining options and local conveniences, making it an ideal location for those looking to enjoy city living.\n\nWith excellent public transport links nearby and the canal area within easy reach, Clanbrassil Street provides a convenient base for commuters and city residents alike. Portobello’s central location and lively neighbourhood atmosphere make it a highly sought-after area in Dublin 8.\n\n",
